# Tags — Web feed repository context

Tags is an AI-powered virtual try-on shopping platform.

The broader product includes a Chrome extension and a mobile-style discovery feed. **This repository focuses only on the responsive web feed.**

## Feed experience

- TikTok-style, vertically scrollable discovery feed
- Each feed item is a new outfit shown on the user
- One outfit should feel like roughly one viewport on mobile

## Hackathon scope

- Hardcoded clothing catalog (no real retailer ingestion or scraping)
- Outfit try-on media may be pre-rendered with Decart Lucy VTON and bundled in the app
- No authentication
- No database
- No sizing or fit prediction
- Keep the implementation simple and demo-focused

## Feed item (target shape)

Each item should eventually include:

- Store
- Item title
- Price
- Media showing the outfit on the user
- **Buy this look** action (eventually leading to a Visa checkout experience)

## Design direction

- Black and white
- Minimal
- No rounded corners
- No gradients
- Avoid decorative shadows
- Strong spacing and typography
- Mobile-first, responsive on desktop
